  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 697
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Mary starts on my hair, snipping and shearing away at loose ends, humming
    a pleasant tune as she works.{wc}I wince occasionally as her scissors part a
    tangled clump of hair.
