  itemId: 689
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Mary pulls a pair of delicate silver scissors from her bag as I drag
    myself out of bed and into the chair.{wc}I take another, closer look at Mary.
    She looks tired, and her skin somewhat pallid.{wc}She looks a lot less healthy
    than she did yesterday.
